  "2026-09-08T06:41:04.469Z","harness:codex","Reproduction cleanup evidence: the managed extension registry changed only its generated timestamp, with identical package entries. Test-created Git fence changes were restored and the two precisely identified synthetic merge receipts were quarantined from the runtime evidence set. Final verification uses an external scratch root without a tracker ancestor."
  "2026-09-08T06:55:58.650Z","harness:codex","Final verification: full sandbox coverage completed successfully with --maxWorkers 4; all exact coverage thresholds pass. Static gates, docs/skills, SDK boundary/parity and graph/record-integrity gates pass. Earlier environmental failures and the resource-contention rerun remain documented; this evidence applies to the final local delivery."
